      "content": "The valuation relies heavily on that patent being rock solid. If they start digging into the recent filing activities or if they see any signs of legal friction or challenges to its validity, the whole $1.2B number collapses. Should I mention the ongoing review regarding the patent's validity, or is it better to keep the focus strictly on the technical moats like you suggested?",
